# Sigvault Desktop — Build-time Configuration
# These values are burned into the binary at compile time.
#
# For local development, generate this file with:
#   ee hydrate development -c .ee.desktop -o .env
#
# Or copy this file to .env and adjust values manually.
#
# Note: API_BASE_URL and BITCOIN_NETWORK are no longer compile-time vars.
# The desktop app fetches the available environments at runtime from
# https://sigvault.org/environments.json and lets the user pick one
# before logging in.

